              in the order relation (by subtopos inclusion) between levels.
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              The condition
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mo ◯
                      %mi j
                    %msub
                      %mo □
                      %mi i
                    %mo =
                    %msub
                      %mo □
                      %mi i
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \bigcirc_j \Box_i=\Box_i
              amounts to saying that every
              = succeed "-skeleton" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi i
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} i
              = succeed "-sheaf:" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
